  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Drive your tractor into the storm funnel. Suction, orbit, lift and gusts
    act on the physical truck. Reach each new 10-metre altitude tier for 5 points,
    complete a full rotation for 12, fit your whole truck through an aerial ring
    for 30, avoid a close flying object for 3, and land upright under control for
    40. Rings and debris score once per real flight. In the air, left/right gives
    limited correction and roll; forward/back gives limited correction and pitch.
    Release forward/back once after lift-off to arm that correction. ACTION opens
    a seven-second flare: reduced lift, outward drag and upright torque help you
    leave the funnel and land. The flare has an eight-second cooldown. A controlled
    landing requires wheel support for 0.8 seconds, a mostly upright truck, downward
    contact speed at most 12 m/s and ground speed at most 16 m/s. An uncontrolled
    landing earns no bonus. Drive back into the funnel for another flight. On the
    ground, ACTION can self-right a slow overturned tractor with a physical hop;
    there are no active-run teleports. Flying sheep are cartoonish and unharmed.
    AI drives in, attempts real stunts, flares and lands using the same controls.
    The timed match counts actual actions; tied scores share first place. Profiles,
    horn, free-look, shared/chase/cab views, pause and rematch use the collection
    controls.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
